{:title
 "The Marker Penalty Trial, Shorter Reasoning by Penalising Words Like Wait",
 :description
 "The Marker Penalty Trial of September 2026, a contained exploration of lowering the logits of hesitation markers such as wait and alternatively in quantized reasoning models, tried across my local models, with its commits.",
 :keywords
