 :paras
 ["Its README records the asking, to research, extend and implement a method shared on Reddit, install what it needs and verify it across all my models, and the method itself. A paper observes that quantized reasoning models sample words such as wait, but and alternatively more often and reason longer while answering less accurately, and it lowers the logits of such marker tokens at sampling time with no training, reporting 12 to 23 percent shorter reasoning with accuracy kept.[[r]] The trial was kept contained, touching none of Smile's model settings."
